<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Affinity Tech said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Affinity Tech said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette downgraded Affinity Technology Inc to market perform from outperform, according to a DLJ source.</p>
<p>-- shares dropped 1-7/8 to 10 in midmorning exchange trading.</p>
</text>
